        "spans_beyond_this_verse": true,
        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "Once those two great-souls who endowed with musical talent and with all remarkable features, sung this epic, standing nearby the midst of a gathering of sages and pious souls. [1-4-14]"
      }
    ],
